<title>ITALY: Three small shares to leave Milan Bourse Monday.</title>
<headline>Three small shares to leave Milan Bourse Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three shares will be cancelled from listing on the Milan stockmarket from Monday because public buy offers have resulted in practically no stock left being quoted, the Italian bourse authority Consob said.</p>
<p>The three are La Magona d'Italia, Texmantova and a &quot;second market&quot; stock Calzaturificio Di Varese.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
